# The image bakes data/ in (see Dockerfile: COPY data/ /app/data/), so anything
# left here is paid for on every single build. These are the files that are
# never read inside a container:
#
#   udemy_courses.csv  -- consumed only by src/scripts/ingest_kaggle_data.py,
#                         a HOST-side preprocessing step that produces
#                         normalized_kaggle_courses.json. 208 MB.
#   corpus_v0/v1.json  -- training inputs for the blue/green artifacts. Consumed
#                         by train_centroids_bigk.py, which also runs on the
#                         host. The trained artifacts themselves (centroids_v*.json)
#                         ARE needed at runtime and are deliberately NOT excluded.
#
# normalized_kaggle_courses.json stays: the in-cluster retrain Job
# (k8s/50-retrain-job.yaml) trains from it.
data/raw/udemy_courses.csv
data/raw/corpus_v0.json
data/raw/corpus_v1.json

.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
data/benchmarks/plots
